@title 3D Heat vents: before any run the openings show no measured flow and the panel says why
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The cabinet with one small grille, no run yet: the Vents and fans panel lists the opening without a flow, and no air-in/out balance is claimed. This is the state with nothing solved; a result from before the solver reported openings falls back to the old speed reading with the same wording (covered by the heat_openings unit test).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-small-grille.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
# Opening Heat starts an automatic run: stop it, switch Auto off so it does not restart, and stop again, so no run is left.
click_text Cancel
wait 10
click_text Auto #1
wait 10
wait 30
try click_text Cancel
wait 30
try click_text Cancel
wait 20
shot 01-no-run
expect "Vents and fans"
expect_not "Preliminary"
check_layout
check_blank 01-no-run
